[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4950284045","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121094#issuecomment-4950284045","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121094","id":4950284045,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJw9XDQ","user":{"login":"Oblepikha","id":77234360,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3MjM0MzYw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77234360?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oblepikha","html_url":"https://github.com/Oblepikha","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oblepikha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oblepikha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oblepikha/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oblepikha/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oblepikha/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oblepikha/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oblepikha/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oblepikha/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oblepikha/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-12T06:51:11Z","updated_at":"2026-07-12T06:51:11Z","body":"My results from 4.8.dev1\n1. Changing detector `monitoring` in the inspector - works fine\n2. Changing target `monitorable` in the inspector - does not work\n3. Changing detector `collision_mask` in the inspector - works fine\n4. Changing target `collision_layer` in the inspector- works fine\n5. Changing target `monitoring` in the inspector - should not trigger exited/entered signals, but it does\n6. Changing target `monitoring` in code - works as expected only when changed in `_physics_process` (does not trigger exited/entered signals)\n7. Changing target `monitorable` while overlapping - does not work\n\nThere is one more way to change the collision state: changing the `disabled` property of a `CollisionShape2D` node\n\n```gdscript\ncollision_shape_2d.disabled = not collision_shape_2d.disabled\n# OR\nfor owner_id in get_shape_owners():\n\tshape_owner_set_disabled(owner_id, not is_shape_owner_disabled(owner_id))\n```\n\nAnd it works in all cases","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4950284045/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4950740611","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121094#issuecomment-4950740611","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121094","id":4950740611,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJxZOgw","user":{"login":"MadeScientist","id":190612698,"node_id":"U_kgDOC1yE2g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190612698?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MadeScientist","html_url":"https://github.com/MadeScientist","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MadeScientist/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MadeScientist/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MadeScientist/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MadeScientist/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MadeScientist/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MadeScientist/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MadeScientist/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MadeScientist/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MadeScientist/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-12T09:49:39Z","updated_at":"2026-07-12T09:49:39Z","body":"> My results from 4.8.dev1\n\nTha